Welcome @fdesouza to @scale_AI as CEO. Alexandr Wang started Scale a decade ago at 19, and it has become a key player in the AI industry, supporting frontier labs, Fortune 500 companies, and the US Government.

Francis is an exceptional leader who will take Scale to greater heights. Wang thanks @jdroege for his leadership as interim CEO.

@fdesouza announces he is joining Scale as CEO, starting August 10. Scale works with top AI labs to push the frontier and helps enterprises and governments deploy reliable AI systems for critical decisions. He is excited to lead a company with a mission to develop trustworthy AI.

Great initiative (RSI benchmark) from @ScaleAILabs and @mhrezaeics.

@mhrezaeics: "Launching. The work of AI R&D has always belonged to humans. For the first time, though, it no longer seems certain that it always will. Recursive self-improvement is within a line of sight. It may still be far, but it is close enough that we should start measuring it."

The RSI Benchmark provides tasks, graded solver runs, and agent traces to evaluate progress toward recursive self-improvement in AI.
